(Al Jamia Knowledge World is a sprawling educational campus designed by Attiks Architecture for the Al Jamia) Tj
T* (educational institutions in Malappuram, Kerala.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The campus encompasses the Al Jamia Arts & Science School and supporting institutional facilities, conceived as) Tj
T* (a cohesive architectural landscape that responds to the tropical climate and pedagogical vision of the institution.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The design integrates skylights, bridged circulation, and open courtyards to create learning environments that are) Tj
T* (naturally lit, well-ventilated, and deeply connected to their surroundings. Every space — from classrooms to) Tj
T* (transitional corridors — is crafted to foster curiosity, collaboration, and a sense of belonging.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Recognised by the grand jury's shortlisted entries for notable architectural achievements, the project represents) Tj
T* (Attiks Architecture's commitment to meaningful institutional design.) Tj
